                                    <h6 class="fw-bold text-primary small"><i class="ri-shield-cross-line me-1"></i>Defensive & Boundary Testing</h6>
                                    <ul class="text-muted small ps-3 mb-0">
                                        <li><strong>Null-Guard Resiliency:</strong> Verifies methods handle null parameters gracefully without unexpected <code>NullReferenceException</code> crashes.</li>
                                        <li><strong>Boundary Identifiers:</strong> Tests zero, negative, or max integer values (e.g. <code>id = -1</code>).</li>
                                        <li><strong>Negative Business States:</strong> Tests invalid or rejected workflow statuses.</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6">
