                                        <li><strong>Upload BRDs:</strong> Ingests PDFs, Word (.docx), Markdown, or Text files.</li>
                                        <li><strong>Rule Extraction:</strong> Scans for keywords like <em>"must"</em>, <em>"should"</em>, <em>"verify"</em>, <em>"validation"</em>, <em>"approval"</em>.</li>
                                        <li><strong>Traceability Matrix:</strong> Links each rule clause directly to generated unit test assertions.</li>
                                    </ul>
